{"id":"beneficial-ownership","version":"script-v2","module":"beneficial-ownership","topic":"beneficial-ownership","title":"Look through","duration":60,"lang":"en","seed":20261114,"ledger":{"path":"academy/films/beneficial-ownership.script.md","status":"signed off"},"law":[{"celex":"32024R1624","arts":["2","20","21","22","24","51","52","53","54","90"]}],"alt":"Animated explainer: an ownership chart for a fictional company. Percentages travel up the chart; a bar meter shows each person against the 25 % line; the arithmetic is written on screen. The captions below the picture carry every word, and a full transcript follows the player.","poster":31,"camera":[{"t":0,"x":1820,"y":860,"z":1.8},{"t":0.4,"x":1820,"y":858,"z":1.76,"e":"lin"},{"t":5.6,"x":1820,"y":800,"z":1.1,"e":"cam"},{"t":6,"x":1820,"y":795,"z":1.1,"e":"lin"},{"t":11.8,"x":1820,"y":770,"z":1.25,"e":"lin"},{"t":13.4,"x":2150,"y":600,"z":0.74,"e":"cam","dip":0.1},{"t":18,"x":2155,"y":600,"z":0.73,"e":"lin"},{"t":19.4,"x":2300,"y":560,"z":0.8,"e":"cam"},{"t":26,"x":2305,"y":562,"z":0.81,"e":"lin"},{"t":27.2,"x":2300,"y":590,"z":0.79,"e":"cam","dip":0.12},{"t":32,"x":2300,"y":592,"z":0.78,"e":"lin"},{"t":33.4,"x":1350,"y":620,"z":1,"e":"cam","dip":0.1},{"t":39,"x":1340,"y":620,"z":1.02,"e":"lin"},{"t":40.2,"x":4560,"y":560,"z":0.95,"e":"cam","dip":0.2},{"t":46,"x":4565,"y":560,"z":0.96,"e":"lin"},{"t":47,"x":6380,"y":580,"z":0.85,"e":"cam","dip":0.2},{"t":57,"x":6385,"y":580,"z":0.86,"e":"lin"},{"t":60,"x":6385,"y":580,"z":0.84,"e":"outCubic"}],"dim":[[57,1],[57.6,0.32]],"chapters":[{"t":0,"n":"Hook"},{"t":6,"n":"Who counts"},{"t":12,"n":"Ownership"},{"t":18,"n":"Multiply, then add"},{"t":32,"n":"Control"},{"t":39,"n":"Verify"},{"t":46,"n":"What goes wrong"},{"t":57,"n":"End card"}],"captions":[{"t0":0,"t1":6,"text":"One example scenario: Velmont Analytics, a fictional company, applies for an account at Orrin, a fictional crypto-asset service provider. The pattern to watch, one common example: a stake split up so that no single piece looks big. A warning sign, not proof."},{"t0":6,"t1":12,"text":"A beneficial owner is any natural person who ultimately owns or controls a legal entity. Control by other means is checked in parallel with ownership."},{"t0":12,"t1":18,"text":"Ownership means 25 % or more of the shares, voting rights or other ownership interest, directly or indirectly. Mira holds 30 % directly: she is a beneficial owner."},{"t0":18,"t1":26,"text":"Through a company, multiply along the chain. Kappa Holding owns 40 % of Velmont, and Jonas owns 45 % of Kappa: 45 % of 40 % is 18 %. Elif reaches 14 %, Tom 8 %."},{"t0":26,"t1":32,"text":"Then add his direct and indirect holdings together. Jonas also holds 8 % of Velmont directly: 18 % plus 8 % is 26 %. He is a beneficial owner."},{"t0":32,"t1":39,"text":"Victor holds no shares, but an agreement gives him the right to appoint or remove a majority of the board. That is control by other means: he is a beneficial owner too. On these facts, Elif and Tom are not."},{"t0":39,"t1":46,"text":"Identify all three, take reasonable measures to verify who they are, and consult the central register as well. Differences from the register are, as a rule, reported to it."},{"t0":46,"t1":53,"text":"Common warning signs, not proof: nominees with no explanation, long or circular chains with no business reason, an owner who will not be named. Miss an owner and you miss the sanctions and politically exposed person checks on that person."},{"t0":53,"t1":57,"text":"If no one can be identified after exhausting all possible means, record that, and identify and verify the senior managing officials. If due diligence still cannot be completed, do not proceed."},{"t0":57,"t1":60,"text":"Look through every layer to the natural persons behind it. The AMLR, Regulation (EU) 2024/1624, applies from 10 July 2027."}],"headers":[{"t0":6.3,"t1":11.7,"eyebrow":"01 · WHO COUNTS","lines":["A natural person. Owns or controls."],"accent":"cool"},{"t0":12.3,"t1"